{"parentUuid":"00d42037-4d6c-462d-9d57-3fd8cddfa31e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgsb7TiWASy7nBYNWXk3e","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```ts\nimport { DurableObject } from \"cloudflare:workers\";\n\nconst HOUR_MS = 60 * 60 * 1000;\n\nexport class ChatRoom extends DurableObject<Env> {\n  // Tail of the write chain. Each write starts after the previous one settles.\n  #queue: Promise<unknown> = Promise.resolve();\n\n  constructor(ctx: DurableObjectState, env: Env) {\n    super(ctx, env);\n    // Schedule the first hourly wake-up once. Later constructions see the existing alarm and leave it alone.\n    ctx.blockConcurrencyWhile(async () => {\n      if ((await ctx.storage.getAlarm()) === null) {\n        await ctx.storage.setAlarm(Date.now() + HOUR_MS);\n      }\n    });\n  }\n\n  #serialize<T>(fn: () => Promise<T>): Promise<T> {\n    const run = this.#queue.then(fn);\n    // Keep the chain alive when a write fails.\n    this.#queue = run.catch(() => {});\n    return run;\n  }\n\n  async set(key: string, value: unknown): Promise<void> {\n    return this.#serialize(() => this.ctx.storage.put(key, value));\n  }\n\n  async get(key: string): Promise<unknown> {\n    return this.ctx.storage.get(key);\n  }\n\n  async alarm(): Promise<void> {\n    // Reschedule before the work. If the work throws, the alarm still runs again in an hour.\n    await this.ctx.storage.setAlarm(Date.now() + HOUR_MS);\n    await this.#serialize(async () => {\n      // Hourly work goes here.\n      await this.ctx.storage.put(\"lastTick\", Date.now());\n    });\n  }\n}\n```\n\nThe class needs a `ChatRoom` binding in `wrangler.jsonc` with a migration that includes `\"new_sqlite_classes\": [\"ChatRoom\"]`. I did not check the repo for an existing `Env` type or binding name, so adjust those to match.\n\nI wrote the class inline and did not change any files in the repo."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6574,"cache_read_input_tokens":9130,"output_tokens":2153,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1459},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6574,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2153,"cache_read_input_tokens":9130,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6574,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6574},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null}},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestedModel":"claude-haiku-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"1c7bd8fb-de48-42f2-942b-beb0167aa736","timestamp":"2026-11-09T15:27:04.212Z","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","sessionId":"7dc59f1f-bfe4-4ef8-91c4-433a7b093b20","version":"2.1.319"}
